#N canvas 40 40 900 700 12;
#X text 20 15 bamodulex~ - AmbiX to the four feeds of an upright tetrahedron (seam-ltm);
#X text 20 45 No parameters. Inlets: W Y Z X (AmbiX ACN). Outlets: LFU RFD RBU LBD (left-front-up right-front-down right-back-up left-back-down). Gerzon BA-module with 1/2 normalisation: LFU = (W+Y+Z+X)/2 RFD = (W-Y-Z+X)/2 RBU = (W-Y+Z-X)/2 LBD = (W+Y-Z-X)/2. The matrix is orthogonal and rate-independent. Same DSP as the seam-ltm VST3 plugin., f 90;
#X text 20 150 example chain: noise into lr2xhgr~ into bamodulex~;
#X obj 20 180 tgl 19 0 empty empty noise~ 24 10 0 12 #dfdfdf #000000 #000000 0 1;
#X obj 20 215 * 0.1;
#X obj 120 215 noise~;
#X obj 200 215 noise~;
#X obj 120 250 *~ 0;
#X obj 200 250 *~ 0;
#X obj 120 300 lr2xhgr~;
#X obj 120 350 bamodulex~;
#X text 20 400 outputs;
#X obj 20 430 tgl 19 0 empty empty listen on dac~ 1-4 24 10 0 12 #dfdfdf #000000 #000000 0 1;
#X obj 20 660 dac~ 1 2 3 4;
#X obj 20 470 env~ 1024;
#X obj 20 500 - 100;
#X obj 20 530 vu 15 120 empty LFU -1 -10 0 12 #404040 #000000 1 0;
#X obj 20 630 *~ 0;
#X obj 100 470 env~ 1024;
#X obj 100 500 - 100;
#X obj 100 530 vu 15 120 empty RFD -1 -10 0 12 #404040 #000000 1 0;
#X obj 100 630 *~ 0;
#X obj 180 470 env~ 1024;
#X obj 180 500 - 100;
#X obj 180 530 vu 15 120 empty RBU -1 -10 0 12 #404040 #000000 1 0;
#X obj 180 630 *~ 0;
#X obj 260 470 env~ 1024;
#X obj 260 500 - 100;
#X obj 260 530 vu 15 120 empty LBD -1 -10 0 12 #404040 #000000 1 0;
#X obj 260 630 *~ 0;
